From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caboose <caboose@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] Reuse image views and profile blocking reads

Chromium's ANGLE creates and destroys the same image views every frame, each
waiting a round trip for the host's handle. A destroyed view of an image this
encoder created is parked, and an identical request reuses it; parked views are
destroyed for real before their image or device.

CABOOSE_READ_PROFILE=1 reports, every two seconds on stderr, the time spent
blocked reading replies per opcode.
---
